t darkness always lurked close waiting  to pounce on him when the end approached  the destiny he had in common with many  are tricks to god like loki condemned to  imprisonment misery and torture but i  want to leave you on such a serious note  horus would not agree i will instead ask  you to post in the comments what is the  greatest prank you ever witnessed or  even better performed and as always  thank you for watching now just before  you leave today's video let me tell you  about another channel that i run called  decoding the unknown it's a show where i  take a deep dive in some of the world's  biggest mysteries from what happened to  the roanoke colonists the regular guy  who found a listening device in one of  his power strips it's always a bit of a  wild ride you can find a link to  decoding the unknown below or just  search decoding the unknown in youtube  and you will find it  [Music]

